<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`row-bound.ts` keeps the newest `VERDICT_ROW_COUNT` verdict rows in the control document and sheds the oldest batch whole, each row with the effect row that still names its request, by retract in one change. A count, never a clock. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

<<~/ahu>>

